://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135688004,imgsize-62234.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Scrap Rs 500 notes': CM Naidu seeks to phase out big currency to curb corruption]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/scrap-rs-500-notes-cm-naidu-seeks-to-phase-out-big-currency-to-curb-corruption/articleshow/135685736.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135685736.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Andhra Pradesh chief minister N Chandrababu Naidu advocates for the abolition of Rs 500 and other high-value banknotes to combat corruption and promote a shift to digital transactions, which he believes is vital for economic enhancement. The recent local election results revealed a strong tilt toward the National Democratic Alliance, especially in urban regions, indicating a robust affirmation of democratic ideals and effective governance across Andhra Pradesh.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/scrap-rs-500-notes-cm-naidu-seeks-to-phase-out-big-currency-to-curb-corruption/articleshow/135685736.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/scrap-rs-500-notes-cm-naidu-seeks-to-phase-out-big-currency-to-curb-corruption/articleshow/135685736.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-09T20:58:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135686009,imgsize-77196.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['There is an old saying': BJP MLA Papiya Adhikari explains her 'firecrackers cure illness' remark, apologises]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/there-is-an-old-saying-bjp-mla-papiya-adhikari-explains-her-firecrackers-cure-illness-remark-apologises/a