ze-985637.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Why spend on R&amp;D?' Rajeev Chandrasekhar mocks China's 'easier way' over Nvidia spy claim]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-spend-on-rd-rajeev-chandrasekhar-mocks-chinas-easier-way-over-nvidia-spy-claim/articleshow/135681301.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135681301.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rajeev Chandrasekhar highlighted the recent honeytrapping allegations against Nvidia's CEO Jensen Huang involving China. He criticised China's ethical standards in technology acquisition and alleged espionage practices. China responded by denying these allegations and labeling them as baseless. An independent investigation has been launched by Nvidia's board regarding the claims. Huang has also admitted to personal issues but maintains no national security breaches occurred.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-spend-on-rd-rajeev-chandrasekhar-mocks-chinas-easier-way-over-nvidia-spy-claim/articleshow/135681301.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-spend-on-rd-rajeev-chandrasekhar-mocks-chinas-easier-way-over-nvidia-spy-claim/articleshow/135681301.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-09T17:58:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135682219,imgsize-245098.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening newswrap: Nvidia boss in Chinese spy scandal; Delhi's AQI turns severe; Iran's hidden oil network in China, and more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-nvidia-boss-in-chinese-spy-scandal-delhis-aqi-turns-severe-irans-hidden-oil-network-in-china-and-more/articleshow/135681779.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" sty